{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2023-04-26 12:00:00', 'title': "AEP RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF AMERICA'S BEST EMPLOYERS FOR DIVERSITY", 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) WAS INCLUDED IN FORBES BEST EMPLOYERS FOR DIVERSITY LIST. THE LIST WAS DEVELOPED BASED ON AN INDEPENDENT SURVEY FROM A SAMPLE OF APPROXIMATELY 45,000 U.S.-BASED EMPLOYEES.'}